{"id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-iterated-consistency.md","title":"Finite Iteration with Chosen Consistency Predicates","display":"df-iterated-consistency — Finite Iteration with Chosen Consistency Predicates","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-iterated-consistency","aliases":["92-df-iterated-consistency"],"display":"df-iterated-consistency — Finite Iteration with Chosen Consistency Predicates","source":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；有限一致性迭代为本地扩展","source_status":"本地扩展；原书仅提供所用不完备性工具","depends_on":["[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-theory-closure]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","[[92-df-theory-system]]","[[92-df-theory]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-iterated-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-iterated-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iterated-consistency — Finite Iteration with Chosen Consistency Predicates"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；有限一致性迭代为本地扩展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地扩展；原书仅提供所用不完备性工具"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a02811a5f1367e7a\" href=\"?note=a02811a5f1367e7a\" title=\"92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement\">92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{Theory}_G(S)\\land\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(S)\\land\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq S\\}\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{Theory}_G(S)\\land\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(S)\\land\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq S\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span> 选定一元公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_S\">\\(B_S\\)</span>，其自由变量包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\{v_0\\}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)}(B_S)\">\\(\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)}(B_S)\\)</span>；这里的选择函数不预设可计算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(S)=C_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S),B_S,\\bot_G}\">\\(C(S)=C_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S),B_S,\\bot_G}\\)</span>；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bot_G\">\\(\\neg\\bot_G\\)</span>，所以各呈现均可反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\)</span> 是一阶后承闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{(n)},\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\">\\(T^{(n)},\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\)</span> 为下文定义的有限迭代与闭句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\nT^{(0)}&amp;\\coloneqq T,\\\\\nT^{(n+1)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\bigl(T^{(n)}\\cup\\{C(T^{(n)})\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)&amp;\\coloneqq C(T^{(n)}),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nT^{(n)}&amp;\\in\\mathcal D.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\nT^{(0)}&amp;\\coloneqq T,\\\\\nT^{(n+1)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\bigl(T^{(n)}\\cup\\{C(T^{(n)})\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)&amp;\\coloneqq C(T^{(n)}),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nT^{(n)}&amp;\\in\\mathcal D.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对每个固定的有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，在已有 c.e. 公理呈现上增加一条闭句仍可递归公理化；闭包不改变可递归公理化性。该有限归纳不要求选择函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\mapsto B_S\">\\(S\\mapsto B_S\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n<p>若要统一计算输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的阶段公理枚举器，还需提供呈现索引的有效更新和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_S\">\\(B_S\\)</span> 的有效选择。本定义未构造这些程序。每层一致性与 HBL 条件也没有被定义偷偷保证：普通基理论相容性不能推出添加其一致性句后的所有阶段相容。</p>\n<p>这是本库扩展材料，原书没有发展此一致性迭代层级。原书第 IX 章仅提供所选一致性句及其不可证性工具。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 pp. 108–110（PDF 125–127）；有限一致性迭代为本地扩展。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"a02811a5f1367e7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-closure","status":"resolved","id":"668e712bdadc015a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-contradiction","status":"resolved","id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-contradiction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\{S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\\mathrm{Theory}_G(S)\\land\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(S)\\land\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\subseteq S\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"B_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\{v_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CorrectProv}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)}(B_S)","display":false},{"tex":"C(S)=C_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S),B_S,\\bot_G}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_G","display":false},{"tex":"T^{(n)},\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\nT^{(0)}&\\coloneqq T,\\\\\nT^{(n+1)}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\bigl(T^{(n)}\\cup\\{C(T^{(n)})\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)&\\coloneqq C(T^{(n)}),\\\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\nT^{(n)}&\\in\\mathcal D.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\mapsto B_S","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"B_S","display":false}],"bytes":2583,"backlinks":[{"id":"e3886f8e5c8d0f18","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ (iterated-consistency progression, see [[92-df-iterated-consistency]])"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"任意所选系统和谓词的一致性句见[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]。[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]与[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy]]是附有额外条件的本地扩展。"},{"id":"115b0689f1a67703","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$、$B_{T^{(n)}}$、$\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)$ 是[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]的所选迭代。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-iterated-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["a02811a5f1367e7a","668e712bdadc015a","90f32e29c9d553ed","2f9850d6fe4ddc35","09b80989dbe14044","87dbd27955ecb3b6","975b3aa9a1e08797","e0eabee5d77258a7","0dd7c9b3e61cc21b"]}